    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Description</h2>MechaLeague is a fast-paced online VR platformer that uses grab and pull locomotion, grapple hooks and air brakes.<br>Easy to learn but difficult to master, compete with other players on PC and mobile VR headsets and desktop to score the most points and fastest race times.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/420760/extras/ff62eb479338c777c56687457030f5a8.poster.avif?t=1725080267\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/420760/extras/ff62eb479338c777c56687457030f5a8.webm?t=1725080267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/420760/extras/ff62eb479338c777c56687457030f5a8.mp4?t=1725080267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Triple Trials</h2>Currently the game has 2 game modes, Triple Trials and Custom Challenge.<br>You will then play a 3 round match consisting of randomised levels from a rotating pool.<br>Rounds consists of races, orb grab and bomb tag games<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/420760/extras/985762abfdef3a457e26d42b1e536998.poster.avif?t=1725080267\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/420760/extras/985762abfdef3a457e26d42b1e536998.webm?t=1725080267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/420760/extras/985762abfdef3a457e26d42b1e536998.mp4?t=1725080267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Custom Challenge Maps</h2>You can also create your own custom maps filled with platforms and obstacles. <br>Browse all the maps made by other players and compete for the best times on each map.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Cosmetics</h2>After a Triple Trials match you will earn XP which will unlock player cosmetics.<br>Customise every part of your avatar.<br>Contains both free cosmetics and premium cosmetics DLC<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/420760/extras/764d3a9b6ae374b0e7f48f775054cef6.poster.avif?t=1725080267\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/420760/extras/764d3a9b6ae374b0e7f48f775054cef6.webm?t=1725080267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/420760/extras/764d3a9b6ae374b0e7f48f775054cef6.mp4?t=1725080267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Description</h2>MechaLeague is a fast-paced online VR platformer that uses grab and pull locomotion, grapple hooks and air brakes.<br>Easy to learn but difficult to master, compete with other players on PC and mobile VR headsets and desktop to score the most points and fastest race times.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/420760/extras/ff62eb479338c777c56687457030f5a8.poster.avif?t=1725080267\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/420760/extras/ff62eb479338c777c56687457030f5a8.webm?t=1725080267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/420760/extras/ff62eb479338c777c56687457030f5a8.mp4?t=1725080267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Triple Trials</h2>Currently the game has 2 game modes, Triple Trials and Custom Challenge.<br>You will then play a 3 round match consisting of randomised levels from a rotating pool.<br>Rounds consists of races, orb grab and bomb tag games<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/420760/extras/985762abfdef3a457e26d42b1e536998.poster.avif?t=1725080267\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/420760/extras/985762abfdef3a457e26d42b1e536998.webm?t=1725080267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/420760/extras/985762abfdef3a457e26d42b1e536998.mp4?t=1725080267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Custom Challenge Maps</h2>You can also create your own custom maps filled with platforms and obstacles. <br>Browse all the maps made by other players and compete for the best times on each map.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Cosmetics</h2>After a Triple Trials match you will earn XP which will unlock player cosmetics.<br>Customise every part of your avatar.<br>Contains both free cosmetics and premium cosmetics DLC<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/420760/extras/764d3a9b6ae374b0e7f48f775054cef6.poster.avif?t=1725080267\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/420760/extras/764d3a9b6ae374b0e7f48f775054cef6.webm?t=1725080267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/420760/extras/764d3a9b6ae374b0e7f48f775054cef6.mp4?t=1725080267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "short_description": "High speed online multiplayer cross platform VR game. Immersive movement mechanics with arm swing and grapple hooks. Multiple revolving games modes and regular updates with more content.",
